PetalburgWoods_Text_H0::
    .string "It's so dark in here that I keep\n"
    .string "walking into trees.\p"
    .string "The trees don't seem to mind.\n"
    .string "My nose does.$"

PetalburgWoods_Text_H1_0::
    .string "Four WURMPLE! All from this wood!\n"
    .string "Go, go, go, go!$"

PetalburgWoods_Text_H1_1::
    .string "Four of them and still not enough…$"

PetalburgWoods_Text_H1_2::
    .string "They'll evolve one day. Two into\n"
    .string "one thing, two into the other.\l"
    .string "Nobody can tell me which!$"

PetalburgWoods_Text_H2_0::
    .string "I'm JAMES. No, not that JAMES.\n"
    .string "Everyone asks.$"

PetalburgWoods_Text_H2_1::
    .string "Lost anyway. Just like him.$"

PetalburgWoods_Text_H2_2::
    .string "I'm thinking of changing my name.\n"
    .string "Or my hair. One of the two.$"

PetalburgWoods_Text_H3::
    .string "Things get dropped in these woods\n"
    .string "and the leaves cover them over.\p"
    .string "I walk slowly and look down.\n"
    .string "That's how I find stuff.$"

PetalburgWoods_Text_H4::
    .string "Oh! That's the STONE BADGE from\n"
    .string "RUSTBORO!\p"
    .string "Then you've earned this. It helps\n"
    .string "GRASS-type moves hit harder.$"

PetalburgWoods_Text_H5::
    .string "TRAINER TIPS\p"
    .string "A POKéMON that joins a battle for\n"
    .string "even one turn earns EXP. POINTS.\p"
    .string "Lead with the one you want to\n"
    .string "raise, then switch it out.$"

PetalburgWoods_Text_H6::
    .string "TRAINER TIPS\p"
    .string "Every move has PP. When they run\n"
    .string "out, the move stops.\p"
    .string "A POKéMON CENTER fills them up\n"
    .string "again. So does an ETHER.$"

PetalburgWoods_Text_LassNoBadge::
    .string "I'm waiting for someone with the\n"
    .string "BADGE from RUSTBORO's GYM.\p"
    .string "ROXANNE's hard to beat. If you do,\n"
    .string "come and show me!$"

PetalburgWoods_Text_LassAfter::
    .string "A MIRACLE SEED. Give it to a GRASS\n"
    .string "type to hold. It grew in these\l"
    .string "woods, like me.$"

PetalburgWoods_Text_LassBagFull::
    .string "Your BAG's full! Come back when\n"
    .string "there's space.$"

PetalburgWoods_Text_ResearcherHelp::
    .string "You there! Help me, please!\p"
    .string "Someone's been following me since\n"
    .string "PETALBURG. He wants my papers!$"

PetalburgWoods_Text_GruntHandThemOver::
    .string "There you are. Hand over the DEVON\n"
    .string "papers, and nobody gets wet.$"

PetalburgWoods_Text_GruntIntro::
    .string "Who are you? KANTO? Stay out of\n"
    .string "HOENN's business!\p"
    .string "TEAM AQUA doesn't take orders from\n"
    .string "tourists!$"

PetalburgWoods_Text_GruntDefeat::
    .string "Some tourist!$"

PetalburgWoods_Text_JessieHoldIt::
    .string "JESSIE: Not so fast!$"

PetalburgWoods_Text_RocketFollowed::
    .string "JAMES: Did you think one little\n"
    .string "plane ride would shake us off?\p"
    .string "MEOWTH: We rode in the luggage.\n"
    .string "Next to a crate of fish. Not bad.\p"
    .string "JESSIE: Now, those papers smell\n"
    .string "valuable. And so does that PIKACHU!$"

PetalburgWoods_Text_RocketFollowedNoPikachu::
    .string "JAMES: Did you think one little\n"
    .string "plane ride would shake us off?\p"
    .string "MEOWTH: We rode in the luggage.\n"
    .string "Next to a crate of fish. Not bad.\p"
    .string "JESSIE: Now, those papers smell\n"
    .string "valuable. Hand them over, twerp!$"

PetalburgWoods_Text_GruntSlipsAway::
    .string "…You lot can fight over it.\n"
    .string "I'm out of here!$"

PetalburgWoods_Text_RocketDefeat::
    .string "JAMES: HOENN's no kinder to us\n"
    .string "than KANTO was…$"

PetalburgWoods_Text_RocketBlastOff::
    .string "JESSIE: We'll get you next time,\n"
    .string "in HOENN or anywhere else!\p"
    .string "MEOWTH: Can the next time be\n"
    .string "somewhere with a cafe?$"

PetalburgWoods_Text_SilverPowderDropped::
    .string "Where DUSTOX was, a little heap of\n"
    .string "shining scales is left behind.$"

PetalburgWoods_Text_ResearcherThanks::
    .string "Thank you! These papers are for\n"
    .string "DEVON in RUSTBORO. If I'd lost\l"
    .string "them, I'd have lost my job.\p"
    .string "Here. It's all I have with me.$"

PetalburgWoods_Text_ResearcherLeaves::
    .string "I'd better get these to RUSTBORO\n"
    .string "before anyone else wants them.$"

PetalburgWoods_Text_ResearcherBagFull::
    .string "Your BAG's full? I'll wait here\n"
    .string "while you make room. Just be quick.$"

PetalburgWoods_Text_BigTreeQuiet::
    .string "A huge old tree. Something moves\n"
    .string "in the leaves above, then goes\l"
    .string "still.\p"
    .string "It seems to be waiting for the\n"
    .string "woods to calm down.$"

PetalburgWoods_Text_BigTreeRustle::
    .string "The grass at the foot of the big\n"
    .string "tree is shaking!$"

PetalburgWoods_Text_TreeckoGlares::
    .string "A TREECKO drops from the branches\n"
    .string "and glares at {PLAYER}.\p"
    .string "It seems to blame you for all the\n"
    .string "noise in its woods!$"

PetalburgWoods_Text_TreeckoPikachu::
    .string "PIKACHU and TREECKO stare each\n"
    .string "other down. Neither one blinks.$"

PetalburgWoods_Text_TreeckoJoins::
    .string "TREECKO looks {PLAYER}'s team over\n"
    .string "for a long moment.\p"
    .string "Then it hops down from its root\n"
    .string "and stands at {PLAYER}'s feet.$"

PetalburgWoods_Text_TreeckoNoRoom::
    .string "TREECKO climbs back up its tree.\n"
    .string "It will be here when there's room.$"

PetalburgWoods_Text_BigTreeAfter::
    .string "The big tree stands quiet. There's\n"
    .string "a TREECKO-sized dent in the bark.$"
